{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Before we proceed, I need to share an important finding from our department's classroom pilot. The pilot found that the OpenMath Core package requires 90 minutes of mathematics intervention per week for the planned student grouping model. This is a significant difference from the 60 minutes per week currently allocated in the draft implementation plan. I recorded this finding in the department pilot binder, but I should note that the binder has not yet been uploaded to the adoption folder. I believe this discrepancy needs to be addressed before we move forward with final approval."}
```

