{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Thank you, Ms. Patel. That's an important finding. Now, from the library and licensing perspective, I need to share the results of my license review for the OpenMath Core package. The license permits district modifications, but only when every modified print or digital item carries the publisher's exact attribution statement: 'Adapted from OpenMath Core.' I've completed the review, but I should note that the licensing note is still awaiting entry in the library catalog record. This attribution requirement is something we'll need to ensure is followed if the district makes any modifications to the materials."}
```

